    lb: 'Envoy is the engine: TCP proxy listeners for L4, HTTP listeners with routes and virtual hosts for L7. Clusters balance with round-robin, least-request, ring-hash or Maglev, with active HTTP, gRPC or TCP health checks, outlier detection and circuit breakers. Endpoints can be drained project-wide and EDS clusters switched blue/green.',
