    upgrades: 'Listener upgrades to a newer Envoy version use a hot restart (0 dropped requests at 20 req/s in Elchi’s end-to-end test). HA pairs upgrade standby first; Elchi OS upgrades into a second root slot with a health-gated trial boot and automatic rollback.',
