        'Different services must stay on different Envoy versions for a while, and listeners move between versions with a hot restart rather than a fleet-wide upgrade.',
        'You want a WAF (Shield, with the OWASP Core Rule Set), API discovery and GSLB managed in the same UI, with an audit trail and project-level roles.',
